code_tiled": true, "decode_tile_size": true, "tile_debug": true, "offload_device": true, "model": true, "decode_tile_overlap": true, "device": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedVR2LoadVAEModel", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#535", "groupcolor": "#a1309b", "color": "#323"}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["A short-haired woman stands at the edge of a city rooftop, wearing a beige trench coat paired with high-waisted jeans and tortoiseshell sunglasses. A slight smile plays on her lips as she gazes into the distance, her expression relaxed and joyful. In her right hand, she holds a silver smartphone connected by a black lanyard to a compact black power bank hanging from her chest; the power bank's minimalist design complements her overall outfit. The details of her coat's cuffs and belt are clearly visible, while the hem falls naturally, exuding a casual yet refined urban elegance. In the foreground, a dark gray metal railing with clean lines creates a visual separation from the subject while guiding the viewer's focus toward her. The slightly worn edges of the railing add a sense of authenticity and everyday life. Positioned slightly to the right, the woman stands with her body angled, her left arm hanging naturally, conveying a relaxed posture that suggests she is \"enjoying the cityscape.\" The midground features red-brick buildings with varied rooflines and neatly arranged windows; some structures have sloped roofs and chimneys. Their muted tones contrast visually with the woman's light-colored attire, while the distinct layers of the architecture enhance the scene's depth. Dominating the background is the iconic dome of St. Paul's Cathedral, whose grand dome and classical colonnades stand out against a clear sky. Architectural details such as the dome's ring-like structure, window panes, and cornice decorations are clearly visible, evoking a sense of historical weight. Faint outlines of modern skyscrapers in the distance blend the old and new, creating a dynamic urban panorama. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the subject placed on the right side, her gaze naturally extending toward the buildings and the dome to form a visual leading line. A slightly low camera angle emphasizes the solemnity of the architecture while highlighting the woman's lightness. The overall color palette leans warm, with sunlight streaming diagonally from the upper left, illuminating her face and coat to create soft shadows that enhance three-dimensionality. The lighting atmosphere is bright and warm, with sunlight casting a natural halo on her shoulders and hair, while the background buildings are enveloped in a gentle glow, cultivating a tranquil afternoon urban mood. The image brims with a sense of daily life and artistic sensibility; it is neither a professional studio setup nor a staged photograph, but rather a candid moment of natural expression in a real setting. It carries the texture of \"amateur equipment photography\"—clear but not overly sharp, with authentic colors that are not exaggerated, rich details that do not overshadow the subject, and an overall impression of \"a moment of quiet and freedom amidst a city stroll.\""], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 33, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [381.52752685546875, 265.66082763671875], "pos": [2829.04345703125, 754.2767944335938], "id": 27, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["一位短发女性站在城市天台边缘，身着米色风衣，搭配高腰牛仔裤，佩戴玳瑁色太阳镜，嘴角微扬，目光望向远方，神情轻松愉悦。她右手持银色智能手机，手机通过黑色挂绳与胸前悬挂的黑色便携充电宝相连，充电宝表面简洁，与整体穿搭风格协调。她的风衣袖口与腰带细节清晰，衣摆自然垂落，展现出随性又精致的都市气质。\n\n前景为深灰色金属栏杆，线条简洁，与人物形成视觉分隔，同时引导视线向主体聚焦。栏杆边缘略显磨损，增添真实感与生活气息。人物站立位置略微偏右，身体微侧，左手自然下垂，姿态放松，营造出一种“正在享受城市风光”的动态感。\n\n中景为红砖建筑群，屋顶线条错落，窗户整齐排列，部分建筑带有斜坡屋顶与烟囱，色彩沉稳，与人物浅色衣着形成视觉对比。建筑群层次分明，为画面增添纵深感。\n\n背景为标志性圆顶建筑——圣保罗大教堂，其宏伟的穹顶与古典柱廊在晴朗天空下尤为突出，建筑细节清晰可见，如穹顶的环状结构、窗格与檐口装饰，展现出历史厚重感。远处现代高楼隐约可见，与古典建筑形成新旧交融的都市图景。\n\n构图采用三分法，人物位于画面右侧，视线自然延伸至建筑群与穹顶，形成视觉引导线。镜头略微仰拍，强化建筑的庄严感，同时突出人物的轻盈姿态。画面整体偏暖色调，阳光从左上方斜射，照亮人物面部与风衣，形成柔和阴影，增强立体感。\n\n光影氛围明亮而温暖，阳光洒在人物肩部与发丝，形成自然光晕，背景建筑被柔和光晕包围，营造出午后宁静的都市氛围。画面充满生活气息与艺术感，既非专业摄影棚布景，也非刻意摆拍，而是真实场景中人物自然流露的瞬间，带有“日常业余设备拍摄”的质感——清晰但不锐利，色彩真实而不夸张，细节丰富却不喧宾夺主，整体呈现出一种“城市漫步中的片刻宁静与自由”。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 85, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [380.89007568359375, 240.14453125], "pos": [2826.842041015625, 463.05419921875], "id": 12, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [33, 86], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [235.62342834472656, 292.7745666503906], "pos": [2543.1943359375, 539.2000732421875], "widgets_values": ["", 644, "randomize", "force_english"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 83, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "advanced_options"}, "shape": 7, "name": "advanced_options", "label": "advanced_options", "type": "COMBO", "loc